# Files to preserve across sysupgrade. Each line is a path prefix
# that the OpenWrt sysupgrade tool keeps intact.
#
# The whole state directory: alongside config.json/identities.json it holds
# tollgate.db (durable sessions + quotes), the per-mint wallet *.sqlite
# files (proofs — losing them is silent balance loss, there is no seed-only
# restore), their WAL/SHM sidecars, wallet_seed.bin and the migration
# tokens.jsonl. The per-mint wallet filenames are derived from mint URLs, so
# they cannot be enumerated here — only the directory prefix covers them.
/etc/tollgate
